    <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800">
      <span data-id="pg104_n0006">Mali, &#xe7;do mbr&#xeb;mje, shkon n&#xeb; shtrat pasmesnate.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0007">T&#xeb; nes&#xeb;rmen duhet t&#xeb; zgjohet n&#xeb; or&#xeb;n 07:00, p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u p&#xeb;rgatitur p&#xeb;r shkoll&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0008">Ai &#xe7;do mbr&#xeb;mje i l&#xeb; gati rrobat e shkoll&#xeb;s, k&#xeb;shtu q&#xeb; n&#xeb; m&#xeb;ngjes i vesh shpejt e shpejt, e shkon me vrap n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0009">Mali m&#xeb;ngjesin e ha n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;, n&#xeb; or&#xeb;n 9 e 30 minuta.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0010">Pas m&#xeb;simit, kthehet n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi i lodhur, ha drek&#xeb;n, l&#xeb;shon perdet e dritareve q&#xeb; t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het err&#xeb;sir&#xeb; dhe menj&#xeb;her&#xeb; shtrihet p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; gjumin e pasdites.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0011">Shok&#xeb;t e th&#xeb;rrasin p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; luajtur futboll ose ndonj&#xeb; loj&#xeb; tjet&#xeb;r n&#xeb; aj&#xeb;r t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r, por ai asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; nuk u bashkohet atyre, sepse i duhet t&#xeb; flej&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0012">Pasi zgjohet, atij i p&#xeb;lqen t&#xeb; haj&#xeb; ushqime t&#xeb; shpejta dhe t&#xeb; pij&#xeb; pije t&#xeb; gazuara.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0013">Nuk ha me orar dhe nuk pi mjaftuesh&#xeb;m uj&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0014">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; brengosur pse Mali &#xeb;sht&#xeb; shum&#xeb; i zbeht&#xeb; dhe nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m.</span>
      <span data-id="pg104_n0015">Prind&#xeb;rit kan&#xeb; vendosur t&#xeb; nd&#xeb;rrojn&#xeb; shprehit&#xeb; e Malit, n&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; q&#xeb; ai t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j&#xeb; nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; sh&#xeb;ndetshme.</span>
